188195,MER-MCRFL1,augusto,Meyerco&reg; Blackie Collins Rifleman Knife,Meyerco&trade; Blackie Collins Rifleman Knife,0,449.990,0,," <EOL>* T-6 Billet Aluminum Handle<br /> <EOL>* Stainless Steel Honed Blade<br /> <EOL>* Steel Cartridge Extractor with DLC Coating<br /> <EOL>* Front Sight Adjustment Tool<br /> <EOL>* Magnesium Fire Starter<br /> <EOL>* Carbide Striker/Glass Breaker<br /> <EOL>* Measures 5-1/4” Closed, 9” Open<br /> <EOL>* Limited Forever Warranty<br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL><b>Description:</b><br /> <EOL>Blackie Collins’ Rifleman™ automatic knife offers the heavy-duty resilience and high-speed deployment signature to his designs. This extraordinary tool is designed to service AR style platforms. T6-6061 billet aluminum is machined into handles that hold a sight adjustment tool for AR style firearms. You will need to specify if you wish to order a 4 or 5 prong sight adjustment tool. Holding the sight adjustment tool in place is a machined aluminum cap that contains a tungsten carbide stud for glass breaking and a magnesium fire starter for emergency preparedness. Tucked neatly into the spine of the handle is a stainless steel cartridge extraction tool with DLC coating. Should the extractor fail, you have a backup on hand if needed. The extractor is held in place with the pressure fit from the machined aluminum cap that screws into the handle. This knife also features a stainless steel honed blade. All this renders you prepared for virtually any need.",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,49231,Meyerco/Designers/Blackie Collins,,308.210,,Wednesday 20 February 2013 12:07:15 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,828,024409946592,250,50,N,182,"Meyerco, LLC"
